From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gregor MacLennan <gmaclennan@awana.digital>
Date: Tue, 28 Jul 2026 19:20:33 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] test: skip/adapt parallel and sequential tests for mobile
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Per-test mobile adaptations, kept deliberately minimal (small anchored
guards; wholesale rewrites are rejected by audit-test-edits.sh in CI —
see the minimal test-edit policy in docs/TESTING.md on the recipe
branch): sandbox paths, no-child-process variants, jitless-iOS
differences, and the fork-only test-mobile-* gates for the patch
series itself.

Co-authored-by: Jaime Bernardo <jaime@janeasystems.com>
Co-authored-by: Andre Staltz <andre@staltz.com>
